      <h2>Local help when you move home in Northampton</h2>
      <p>Chayce Properties is based on Kingsthorpe Road in Northampton, so a move in the town or elsewhere in Northamptonshire is coordinated by people who know the area. Whether you are leaving a family home in Kingsthorpe, Duston or Abington, or moving into a smaller property or retirement development nearby, we plan the whole move around you.</p>
      <p>Many later-life moves involve downsizing after many years in one home. We help you decide what to keep, sell or pass on, pack with care, arrange the removal, liaise with your estate agent and solicitor, and help you settle in at the other end. One dedicated coordinator looks after the whole journey, so you and your family are not juggling several separate companies.</p>
      <p>We also cover the wider East Midlands and surrounding counties, including Kettering, Wellingborough, Daventry, Towcester, Brackley, Rugby, Market Harborough, Milton Keynes and Bedford, with easy road links to London, Oxford, Cambridge and the rest of the country via the M1 and A14. We have local pages for {% for area in localAreas %}<a href="/senior-movers-{{ area.slug }}/">{{ area.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex == 2 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>
      <p>Where to start: <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help for older people</a>, <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/senior-move-manager-uk/">what a senior move manager does</a> and our <a href="/services/">services</a>. Beyond Northamptonshire, see <a href="/areas-we-cover/">areas we cover across the UK</a>.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>Our office is at Unit F2B Barratt House, Kingsthorpe Road, Northampton NN2 6EZ, open Monday to Friday 09:00 to 17:30, closed Saturday and Sunday. Call <a href="tel:+447708925432">07708 925432</a> or email info@chayceproperties.com to arrange a visit or a phone consultation.</p>
      </div></div>
